  "body": "## Ph\u1ea1m vi\n\n\u0110\u01b0a hai \u0111\u1eb7c t\u1ea3 c\u1ee7a Mission #1264 v\u00e0o kho, **ch\u1ec9** t\u1ec7p d\u01b0\u1edbi `ops/specs/`. B\u1ea3n hi\u1ec7n h\u00e0nh l\u00e0 **r13**; r1\u2013r12 gi\u1eef l\u1ea1i \u0111\u1ec3 verdict c\u1ee7a t\u1eebng l\u01b0\u1ee3t review v\u1eabn tra \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c theo b\u0103m.\n\n| \u0110\u1eb7c t\u1ea3 | Packet | sha256 |\n|---|---|---|\n| `ops/specs/THU-HOI-ADMISSION-MERGE-BASE-A-r13.md` | #1265 \u2014 ADR-0066 v\u00e0 m\u1ed9t d\u00f2ng b\u1ea3ng \u00a720 | `10fe7e052b3e0f4c0acc79e844b6d746466e6b3c98fa030222a08df80203d855` |\n| `ops/specs/THU-HOI-ADMISSION-MERGE-BASE-B-r13.md` | #1266 \u2014 b\u1ed9 ki\u1ec3m theo merge-base, receipt v2, test, ch\u00fa th\u00edch workflow, validator C1a1a | `e8ba54b72abffe80f1177d406b2bbdfa63441b4826ff6b45cbd2f798cb6a7d02` |\n\nC\u00e1c revision tr\u01b0\u1edbc, ch\u01b0a t\u1eebng \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c duy\u1ec7t (A r\u1ed3i B):\n\n- r12: `387f2a921c689ab65f069e664e8861585dcd791994b473838f547a87af456455`, `fc5d749442f203c5acbaa7596494ef5eef3354b8659369679639b81037d49480`\n- r11: `222bf3e24656cf99ea7f864d51c674d829d3d1d77c52685a862f45a84f0b8283`, `27f2097149bb5607b25ce3f38adbef889673aa54288ec1c17a7efcb39bcb8ddb`\n- r10: `ba516849926b3708ade5bda86cd991ba96c81496d0332e3ccd4c7b7a131c10e6`, `a71e04196fa7f8c9aa0131920509477b26c4c65bdb863755298be2e8a104b35c`\n- r9: `f8e412899e82f5f6edae378c8d6d21dc8978733895d95bb7ea0e444972a18460`, `99965d5f02e4934694d4ab82ee4089ca787d51729af81ff92ff821d432295df1`\n- r8: `722750798f4d9f5c15e948167c6b020521518752d1e75590956751872d7dd31e`, `908a4a46cbe72bb97dbb21ab72eb5e4ff21862cab165c6975f803948fd08c566`\n- r7: `bb1ddb6b6b1ff9667958e70418081ea912c55b183e270ab952bcfd9cfad5a9b6`, `f3c27ed8245ed4aa08bc2074e900efe2d9e21e55ca8f916dfe383ca3415c73f3`\n- r6: `7dcd8e26ccc21ca4d802560b0a601613cc7c9d2515edf3bc94b3d2582fbf427c`, `b05e2f07cb2103c9e6bc38de5e33290e3bd128ea7284edfb77c600a1a0618646`\n- r5: `82e4b5a58758f05b62ed8da910ddb0aea03dd7a388a9c3170399912911a5d78b`, `9cdd308ebfaa3804fcb7c5712f4321016294003ee1cb6929929dc3531da091b7`\n- r4: `3698490c7c1b41b1885084408d717e95af447143f99f478ac8f236ee11a65d0a`, `cc5cfc5c038a7544ce9d9f330a8a395a205f1c488d43eab2e9cb12f303c7e4ff`\n- r3: `55c44dd50fcc8bed9af386356a061214c2f4d50418aff381e1a8e11b8f8c9758`, `f366fda5c61705ec9915d026c43db40f9aeda404965d7d7f6957fbd3977cdbdd`\n- r2: `ea713edbce5afc04289e6dd8c492a5f5e013f2de871cd849d6fd7893f2ea5b03`, `3f002496d380119c9093c072dda3c690afbfa140c21d6ddfdd792590c17dac69`\n- r1: `7ed6a49c123744e122c84f92c1e9ff26b2d3ec0913dc3e0791bfb1891e0b4b67`, `a4e4a7aad7a885acccfd48c513644467a0b048833d50a0cb101992e400cf9ddf`\n\nN\u1ed9i dung: b\u1ecf ch\u1ed1t \"S l\u00e0 t\u1ed5 ti\u00ean c\u1ee7a H\" c\u1ee7a c\u1ed5ng admission `thu-hoi`, thay b\u1eb1ng c\u1ed5ng v\u00f9ng b\u1eb1ng nhau \u1edf m\u1ecdi merge-base. L\u00fd do v\u00e0 s\u1ed1 \u0111o \u1edf th\u00e2n #1264.\n\nL\u1ecbch s\u1eed commit: `bee50420` r1 \u2026 `a98c8023` r5 (\u0111\u00e3 c\u00f3 tr\u00ean nh\u00e1nh tr\u01b0\u1edbc \u0111\u00e2y). \u0110\u1ea9y m\u1ed9t l\u1ea7n ng\u00e0y 08-11-2026, sau khi c\u00e1c l\u01b0\u1ee3t review 5\u201311 ch\u1ea1y offline tr\u00ean commit c\u1ee5c b\u1ed9: `74072f5a` r6, `a476f89a` r7, `45338e64` r8, `eb53e790` r9, `522089d2` r10, `056544c5` v\u00e0 `19780165` r11, `8a3986b0` v\u00e0 `efed1036` r12, `78af6ccf` **r13**.\n\n## Review \u0111\u1eb7c t\u1ea3\n\nM\u01b0\u1eddi m\u1ed9t l\u01b0\u1ee3t Codex \u0111\u1ed9c l\u1eadp (t\u00ednh n\u0103ng `memories` c\u1ee7a Codex t\u1eaft t\u1eeb l\u01b0\u1ee3t 2). L\u01b0\u1ee3t 1 tr\u00ean PR n\u00e0y, l\u01b0\u1ee3t 2\u20134 tr\u00ean commit \u0111\u00e3 \u0111\u1ea9y, l\u01b0\u1ee3t 5\u201311 offline tr\u00ean commit c\u1ee5c b\u1ed9 tr\u01b0\u1edbc khi \u0111\u1ea9y.\n\n| l\u01b0\u1ee3t | tr\u00ean | k\u1ebft lu\u1eadn | finding |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | r1 | changes_requested | 7 P2, 1 P3 (F01\u2013F08); verdict chi\u1ebfu \u1edf https://github.com/ducthangho/tra-luat/pull/1268#issuecomment-6700056296 |\n| 2 | r2 | changes_requested | 3 P2, 2 P3 (F09\u2013F13) \u21d2 checkpoint l\u1ea7n 1: gi\u1eef merge-base |\n| 3 | r3 | changes_requested | 2 P2 (F14, F15) \u21d2 checkpoint l\u1ea7n 2: \u0111\u1ed5i g\u1ed1c canary |\n| 4 | r4 | changes_requested | 2 P2 (F16, F17) \u21d2 checkpoint l\u1ea7n 3 |\n| 5 | r5 | changes_requested | 2 P2 (F18, F19) |\n| 6 | r6 | changes_requested | 1 P2 (F20) |\n| 7 | r7 | changes_requested | 1 P2, 1 P3 (F21, F22) |\n| 8 | r8 | changes_requested | 1 P2 (F23) \u21d2 checkpoint l\u1ea7n 4: r\u00fat B17 v\u1ec1 \u0111o hi\u1ec7u n\u0103ng |\n| 9 | r10 | changes_requested | 1 P2, 1 P3 (F24, F25) |\n| 10 | r11 | changes_requested | 1 P2, 1 P3 (F26, F27) |\n| 11 | r12 | changes_requested | 1 P2 (F28), kh\u00f4ng P3 |\n\n- T\u1eeb l\u01b0\u1ee3t 5, kh\u00f4ng finding n\u00e0o ch\u1ea1m thu\u1eadt to\u00e1n merge-base, so v\u00f9ng hay h\u1ee3p \u0111\u1ed3ng receipt; m\u1ecdi P2 n\u1eb1m \u1edf th\u01b0\u1edbc nghi\u1ec7m thu (canary B17/B18, r\u1ed3i ma tr\u1eadn \u0111\u1ed9t bi\u1ebfn c\u1ee7a c\u00e1c ca ki\u1ec3m). Thu\u1eadt to\u00e1n t\u00f4 m\u00e0u \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c c\u00e1c l\u01b0\u1ee3t 3, 4, 9, 10 so v\u1edbi `git merge-base --all` tr\u00ean 150\u2013350 c\u1eb7p DAG ng\u1eabu nhi\u00ean m\u1ed7i l\u01b0\u1ee3t, 0 l\u1ec7ch.\n- T\u1eeb l\u01b0\u1ee3t 5, theo ch\u1ec9 \u0111\u1ea1o c\u1ee7a ch\u1ee7 kho ng\u00e0y 07-11-2026, phi\u00ean so\u1ea1n spec ch\u1ec9 h\u1ecfi ch\u1ee7 kho khi h\u01b0\u1edbng \u0111i b\u1ebf t\u1eafc, thi\u1ebfu t\u00e0i nguy\u00ean, hay ph\u00e1t hi\u1ec7n \u0111\u1ea3o ng\u01b0\u1ee3c ch\u1ec9 \u0111\u1ea1o; ba l\u1ea7n \u0111\u00e3 h\u1ecfi l\u00e0 checkpoint l\u1ea7n 4, v\u00e0 hai l\u1ea7n h\u1ebft tr\u1ea7n.\n- Tr\u1ea7n review \u0111\u1eb7c t\u1ea3: ban \u0111\u1ea7u \u2264 2, ch\u1ee7 kho n\u00e2ng th\u00e0nh 3, 4, 10, r\u1ed3i 11; **\u0111\u00e3 d\u00f9ng 11/11**.\n- **r13 ch\u01b0a \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c review b\u1eb1ng Codex.** r13 s\u1eeda F28 \u0111\u00fang c\u00e1ch reviewer l\u01b0\u1ee3t 11 \u0111\u1ec1 ngh\u1ecb (hai \u0111\u1ed9t bi\u1ebfn `amb-m34`, `amb-m35` cho hai v\u1ebf \u00e2m c\u1ee7a B9). Ch\u1ee7 kho ch\u1ecdn \u0111\u1ea9y r13 \u0111\u1ec3 duy\u1ec7t b\u0103m thay v\u00ec n\u00e2ng tr\u1ea7n th\u00eam (08-11-2026).\n- Verdict l\u01b0\u1ee3t 2\u201311 \u0111\u00e3 \u0111\u0103ng ng\u00e0y 08-11-2026 d\u01b0\u1edbi d\u1ea1ng comment chi\u1ebfu, m\u1ed7i comment c\u00f3 to\u00e0n v\u0103n v\u00e0 sha256 (\u0111\u1ecdc ng\u01b0\u1ee3c kh\u1edbp t\u1eebng byte): [l\u01b0\u1ee3t 2](https://github.com/ducthangho/tra-luat/pull/1268#issuecomment-6719593701), [3](https://github.com/ducthangho/tra-luat/pull/1268#issuecomment-6719563697), [4](https://github.com/ducthangho/tra-luat/pull/1268#issuecomment-6719564483), [5](https://github.com/ducthangho/tra-luat/pull/1268#issuecomment-6719566697), [6](https://github.com/ducthangho/tra-luat/pull/1268#issuecomment-6719594572), [7](https://github.com/ducthangho/tra-luat/pull/1268#issuecomment-6719574360), [8](https://github.com/ducthangho/tra-luat/pull/1268#issuecomment-6719575813), [9](https://github.com/ducthangho/tra-luat/pull/1268#issuecomment-6719576572), [10](https://github.com/ducthangho/tra-luat/pull/1268#issuecomment-6719578227), [11](https://github.com/ducthangho/tra-luat/pull/1268#issuecomment-6719592706). Th\u1ee9 t\u1ef1 tr\u00ean PR l\u1ec7ch (l\u01b0\u1ee3t 2 v\u00e0 6 \u0111\u0103ng sau l\u01b0\u1ee3t 11 v\u00ec hai l\u1ea7n g\u1eedi \u0111\u1ea7u b\u1ecb GitHub tr\u1ea3 400).\n- B\u1ea3ng \u0111\u1ed1i chi\u1ebfu t\u1eebng finding \u1edf m\u1ee5c \"Thay \u0111\u1ed5i so v\u1edbi r\u2026\" c\u1ee7a m\u1ed7i \u0111\u1eb7c t\u1ea3 (A m\u1ee5c 8, B m\u1ee5c 10).\n\n## Th\u1ea9m quy\u1ec1n\n\n- Hai v\u00f2ng quy\u1ebft \u0111\u1ecbnh (Q1\u2013Q13) c\u1ee7a ch\u1ee7 kho \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ghi \u1edf th\u00e2n #1264; b\u1ed1n checkpoint v\u00e0 hai l\u1ea7n n\u00e2ng tr\u1ea7n ghi \u1edf \u0111\u1ea7u hai \u0111\u1eb7c t\u1ea3 r13.\n- **\u0110\u00e3 duy\u1ec7t b\u0103m r13** ng\u00e0y 08-11-2026, ghi h\u1ed9 theo l\u1eddi ch\u1ee7 kho trong phi\u00ean chat (nguy\u00ean v\u0103n trong comment): A tr\u00ean [#1265](https://github.com/ducthangho/tra-luat/issues/1265#issuecomment-6719830665), B tr\u00ean [#1266](https://github.com/ducthangho/tra-luat/issues/1266#issuecomment-6719832134). PR n\u00e0y kh\u00f4ng ph\u1ea3i l\u1eddi duy\u1ec7t, v\u00e0 kh\u00f4ng c\u1ea5p lease.\n- `nang_tran` c\u1ee7a B \u0111\u00e3 ch\u1ed1t **\u2264 6 t\u1ec7p / \u2264 780 d\u00f2ng th\u00eam** (Q7 c\u0169: 600) trong comment duy\u1ec7t tr\u00ean #1266.\n- 26 t\u1ec7p kh\u00f4ng \u0111\u1ed5i so v\u1edbi b\u0103m \u1edf tr\u00ean: \u0111\u00e3 ki\u1ec3m `sha256sum` tr\u00ean c\u00e2y commit `78af6ccf` tr\u01b0\u1edbc khi \u0111\u1ea9y.\n\n## Ki\u1ec3m \u0111\u00e3 ch\u1ea1y\n\n- Base `d26b36f`. `origin/master` \u1edf `c15603dc` (\u0111o 08-11-2026); c\u00e1c commit m\u1edbi so v\u1edbi `132d376c` (13 t\u1edbi `27fd808`, r\u1ed3i 15 t\u1edbi `c15603dc`) kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ea1m write set c\u1ee7a A hay B, `ops/thu-hoi/**`, t\u1ec7p policy, hai \u0111\u1eb7c t\u1ea3 cha, `docs/adr/`, `docs/PROTOCOL_DA_PHIEN.md`. Kh\u00f4ng merge master v\u00e0o nh\u00e1nh.\n- Tr\u00ean c\u00e2y `78af6ccf`: `adr-song` rc 0 (64/64), `doctrine-scan` rc 0; c\u00e1c t\u1ec7p ch\u1ec9 d\u00f9ng LF; m\u1ed7i \u0111\u1eb7c t\u1ea3 c\u00f3 \u0111\u00fang m\u1ed9t d\u00f2ng `tran_loi_goi_codex` v\u00e0 m\u1ed9t d\u00f2ng `tran_kich_thuoc_sensitive`; 20 h\u00e0ng nghi\u1ec7m thu nh\u00f3m B1\u2013B12 (18 thu\u1ed9c `ops/lease_publish_test.py`), 35 ID \u0111\u1ed9t bi\u1ebfn kh\u00f4ng tr\u00f9ng.\n- \u0110\u1ea7u v\u00e0o ghim c\u1ee7a B17 (S = `132d376c`, N \u2208 {10, 50, 100, 500}): OID c\u1ee7a H v\u00e0 T d\u1ef1ng l\u1ea1i kh\u1edbp t\u1eebng byte \u1edf phi\u00ean so\u1ea1n spec (Linux) v\u00e0 c\u00e1c review l\u01b0\u1ee3t 6\u201311 (Windows). Chi ph\u00ed b\u01b0\u1edbc t\u00f4 m\u00e0u \u0111o b\u1eb1ng `KhoObject` th\u1eadt: 169 / 367 / 2.874 / 3.828 commit; Linux 1,1\u201324,6 gi\u00e2y; Windows N = 10 v\u00e0 50 xong trong 7\u201324 gi\u00e2y, N = 100 v\u01b0\u1ee3t deadline 60 gi\u00e2y (v\u00ec th\u1ebf Windows ch\u1ec9 b\u1eaft bu\u1ed9c N \u2208 {10, 50}).\n- Fixture B2b d\u1ef1a v\u00e0o control c\u00f3 s\u1eb5n c\u1ee7a t133 (`ops/lease_publish_test.py`, c\u1eb7p (S2, `H_them_tren_S2`) ra rc 0 tr\u00ean m\u00e3 n\u1ec1n).\n\n## Lease\n\n`ai-dang-giu` ra `NG\u01af\u1edcI_GI\u1eee 0` cho c\u1ea3 7 \u0111\u01b0\u1eddng d\u1eabn trong write set c\u1ee7a A v\u00e0 B (06-11-2026, 15:10Z\u201317:08Z cho b\u1ed1n \u0111\u01b0\u1eddng d\u1eabn \u0111o sau c\u00f9ng). r2\u2013r13 kh\u00f4ng qu\u00e9t l\u1ea1i. K\u1ebft qu\u1ea3 n\u00e0y c\u0169 \u0111i theo t\u1eebng nh\u00e1nh m\u1edbi; ng\u01b0\u1eddi c\u1ea5p lease ph\u1ea3i \u0111o l\u1ea1i.\n\n\ud83e\udd16 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n",
